---
---

<section id="specialist-fleet" class="py-20 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Text & Spec Overview -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-sky-400 mb-4">
          <span>Enterprise Logistics Fleet</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
          Purpose-Built Transporters & High-Reach Hiab Cranes
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Moving mobile homes and park units requires specialized equipment that traditional freight hauliers cannot supply. Our modern fleet features air-ride suspension to protect delicate interiors, fixtures, and glazed elements during long-distance transit.
        </p>

        <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="border-l-2 border-amber-500 pl-4">
            <dt class="font-bold text-white text-base">Extendable Step-Deck Beds</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Accommodating chassis lengths up to 50ft and unit widths exceeding standard highway limits.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-amber-500 pl-4">
            <dt class="font-bold text-white text-base">Heavy Duty Winching</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">High-torque hydraulic winches for controlled loading of non-rolling or seized chassis.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-sky-500 pl-4">
            <dt class="font-bold text-white text-base">Heavy Lift Hiab Cranes</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Truck mounted cranes with remote belly-pack control for ultra-precise touchdown on axle stands.</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-sky-500 pl-4">
            <dt class="font-bold text-white text-base">Full Insurance & Risk Audits</dt>
            <dd class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Full Goods in Transit, Public Liability, and bespoke Method Statements & Risk Assessments (RAMS).</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <!-- Compliance & Escort Callout Box -->
      <div id="permits" class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-950 p-8 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-36 w-36 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 blur-2xl"></div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="flex h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
            Abnormal Load Escort Division
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-400/90 font-mono mb-6">ESDAL COMPLIANT • POLICE NOTIFIED</p>

          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Transporting loads wider than 2.9 meters requires statutory advance notifications to highway authorities, police forces, and bridge owners. We take care of all paperwork, route clearance, and provide certified escort vehicles.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Bridge weight & height clearance verification</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Chapter 8 compliant warning escort vehicles</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Pitch access & turning circle feasibility audits</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Ferry booking & customs documentation for export</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
